<Positioned left="760" top="800" width="610"><Container alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#C3D0DCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The pension line is £162.50 of your money, and your employer adds £97.50 a month on top of it.</Text></Container></Positioned>
