<Positioned left="90" top="856" width="610"><Container alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#C3D0DCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Total reward, including the employer pension: £40,170 a year.</Text></Container></Positioned>
