<Positioned left="760" top="856" width="610"><Container alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#C3D0DCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The student loan stops the moment your pay drops below the threshold for the month.</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="44" top="946"><Text fontSize="13" color="#6C7C8CFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Salary, tax code and student loan plan are invented for this employee; the bands, rates and thresholds are the standard ones.</Text></Positioned>
